### Result
{"message":"A new understanding blooms. Socrates concedes the point.","result":"Socrates was persuaded by your curiosity. They join your party! +20 insight.\n\nCONTINUE ↗"}
### Ran Playwright code
```js
await (async (page) => { for(let i=0;i<8;i++){ if(await page.locator('#battleContent .primary-button').count()) break; await page.locator('.move-button').first().click(); await page.waitForTimeout(1100); } return {message:await page.locator('#battleMessage').innerText(), result:await page.locator('#battleContent').innerText()}; })(page);
```

### Result
{"party":"📜\nAristotle · ACTIVETHE OBSERVER · LV. 1\n100/100\n☼\nSocratesTHE QUESTIONER · LV. 1\n98/98","quest":"1 / 3","overlay":false}
### Ran Playwright code
```js
await (async (page) => { await page.locator('#battleContinue').click(); await page.waitForTimeout(300); return {party:await page.locator('#partyList').innerText(),quest:await page.locator('#questCount').innerText(),overlay:await page.locator('#battleOverlay').isVisible()}; })(page);
```

